    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "The scouts spotted a Catastrophe brewing, with no Catastrophe Messengers nearby. We should stay as far away as possible, just in case."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "We can't risk it, no matter what."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...A Catastrophe, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "It's rare to see one raging in the wilderness."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "But we have plenty of experience dealing with Originium in Kazdel, so no need to panic."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...Where's W?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "She's with her team."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...Need her for something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "I'm... not sure. She's changed a lot."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Do you think her personality would change that much just because Theresa is gone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "She's too calm. It's unlike her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "But when we found her on the battlefield earlier, she still had that cynical, sarcastic expression."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "If anything, she's only gotten worse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "That's odd. I never thought you'd be perceptive enough to pick up on these subtle warning signs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...Save the jabs. If W's being quiet, that warning sign's far from 'subtle.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
